       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EXENTRY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WORK-A PIC 9(5)V99.
01 WORK-B PIC 9(5)V99.
01 STATUS-A PIC 99.
01 STATUS-B PIC 99.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-A PIC 9(5)V99.
01 INPUT-B PIC 9(5)V99.
01 OUTPUT-A PIC 9(5)V99.
01 OUTPUT-B PIC 9(5)V99.
01 CODE-A PIC 99.
01 CODE-B PIC 99.
01 TOTAL-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 SUMMARY-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING INPUT-A INPUT-B OUTPUT-A OUTPUT-B
    CODE-A CODE-B TOTAL-AMOUNT SUMMARY-STATUS.
MAIN-ENTRY.
    MOVE ZERO TO WORK-A WORK-B STATUS-A STATUS-B.
    MOVE ZERO TO OUTPUT-A OUTPUT-B CODE-A CODE-B.
    MOVE ZERO TO TOTAL-AMOUNT SUMMARY-STATUS.
    CALL 'EXWRAP' USING BY CONTENT INPUT-A
        BY REFERENCE WORK-A STATUS-A
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 90 TO STATUS-A
            MOVE ZERO TO WORK-A
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'EXWRAP' USING BY CONTENT INPUT-B
        BY REFERENCE WORK-B STATUS-B
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 90 TO STATUS-B
            MOVE ZERO TO WORK-B
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'EXFINAL' USING BY CONTENT WORK-A STATUS-A
        BY REFERENCE OUTPUT-A CODE-A
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 93 TO CODE-A
            MOVE ZERO TO OUTPUT-A
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'EXFINAL' USING BY CONTENT WORK-B STATUS-B
        BY REFERENCE OUTPUT-B CODE-B
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 93 TO CODE-B
            MOVE ZERO TO OUTPUT-B
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'EXJOIN' USING BY CONTENT OUTPUT-A CODE-A
        OUTPUT-B CODE-B
        BY REFERENCE TOTAL-AMOUNT SUMMARY-STATUS
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 94 TO SUMMARY-STATUS
            MOVE ZERO TO TOTAL-AMOUNT
    END-CALL.
    GOBACK.
